{
    "title": "GIF Sticker & WAsticker",
    "description": "We talk & connect on social messenger apps every day. GIF Sticker & WAsticker owns rich types of emoji GIFs, GIFs stickers, love hearts emojis & talking emojis. All stickers are FREE! Use GIF Sticker & WAsticker to start lively chats on WhatsApp & build closer relationships. It helps you better express your feelings and emotions. Fun for all ages!\r\n\r\n<b>GIF Stickers by Theme:</b>\r\n\u2705 3D Emoji GIF Sticker\r\n\u2705 3D Smiley WhatsApp Sticker\r\n\u2705 Sweet Talking Emoji\r\n\u2705 Love Sticker\r\n\u2705 Love Heart GIF Sticker\r\n\u2705 Red Rose Sticker\r\n\u2705 Funny Greeting GIF\r\n\u2705 Happy Birthday Sticker\r\n\u2705 Hug Emoji\r\n\u2705 Kiss Emoji\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udc9e Love Stickers & Love Hearts</b>\r\nEvery time you have sweet chats on WhatsApp, send love stickers & love heart GIFs. It tells more than words! Love collections cover kiss stickers & love heart GIFs for expression of miss, hug stickers & love emoji GIFs for Valentine's day, proposal, anniversary, wedding, etc.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\ude0e 3D Emoji GIFs & Stickers</b>\r\nAttach 3D animated emoji stickers and share it with your friends and family. You can find everything related to 3D emojis here: 3D emoji GIFs, 3D emoji stickers, smileys, talking emoji, etc. 3D emoji stickers & emoji GIFs will bring your chat experience to the next interesting level!\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83c\udf39 Flower & Red Rose GIFs</b>\r\nSend red rose GIF stickers and flower bouquet GIF stickers to express your love every day! Add a romantic vibe to your WhatsApp sweet chats with romantic rose stickers. Celebrate your love story with a beautiful flower bouquet GIF or red rose stickers!\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83c\udf82 Happy Birthday Stickers</b>\r\nInsert happy birthday stickers in your chats and messages. Send happy birthday wishes to all your friends/family with happy birthday stickers. GIF Sticker & WAsticker supports awesome Happy birthday sticker packs, including birthday gifts, birthday cakes, balloons, badges, etc.\r\n\r\n\r\nEasy to Use and Share\r\nJust one tap to share GIF stickers & emoji GIFs through ALL popular chat messengers - WhatsApp, Snapchat, Messenger, Facebook, etc. \r\n\r\nA great bunch of GIF Stickers\r\nGIF Sticker & WAsticker owns a FREE library of amazing GIF stickers, talking emojis, red rose stickers, happy birthday stickers, etc. You\u2019ll be amazed to find the emoji GIFs & GIF stickers that meet your needs and match all occasions: 3D love emojis, love hearts, sweet talk, smiley, love, kiss, hug, red rose, birthday, etc. Both statistic stickers and animated GIFs are available here.\r\n\r\nAdd to WhatsApp \r\nGIF Sticker & WAsticker supports all chat messengers, especially suitable for WhatsApp. Click on WhatsApp icon on the bottom, add sticker pack to WhatsApp and integrate stickers directly into WhatsApp sticker keyboard. Then start sending funny stickers or talking emojis to your friends & families.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf39\ud83c\udf39\ud83c\udf39If you enjoy using GIF Sticker & WAsticker, please share it with your friends and family members. Any problems or feedback, feel free to let us know via fotogrid.apps@gmail.com",
